<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Mire</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 18)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast mire &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Attacks the target's mind, making them believe they are wading through deep 
mud, so they fight more slowly and strike less often: a little less slow than 
the slow spell. The better your spell, the longer it lasts: from half a 
minute to almost two minutes.
</p><p>Mire is a spell of its own: it adds to a slow spell, and haste or quicken 
don't lift it. The target resists with their mind, and the spell may fail; 
either way, casting it starts a fight. You must be standing. It is also found 
on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Slow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Haste</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>